{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates Java code to Python 3 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following Java 8 code to Python 3 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original Java 8 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\nimport java.io.*;\nimport java.util.*;\n\npublic class E {\n\n    public E() {\n        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n        PrintWriter out = new PrintWriter(System.out);\n\n        int n = sc.nextInt();\n        List<Integer> v = new ArrayList<>(), k = new ArrayList<>(), x = new ArrayList<>();\n        String s = sc.next();\n        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n            char c = s.charAt(i);\n            if (c == 'V') v.add(i);\n            else if (c == 'K') k.add(i);\n            else x.add(i);\n        }\n\n        int V = v.size(), K = k.size(), X = x.size();\n        long[][][][] dp = new long[V+1][K+1][X+1][2];\n\n        for (int i = 0; i <= V; i++) {\n            for (int j = 0; j <= K; j++) {\n                for (int l = 0; l <= X; l++) {\n                    dp[i][j][l][0] = dp[i][j][l][1] = Long.MAX_VALUE;\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        dp[0][0][0][0] = 0;\n\n        for (int i = 0; i <= V; i++) {\n            for (int j = 0; j <= K; j++) {\n                for (int l = 0; l <= X; l++) {\n                    for (int state = 0; state < 2; state++) {\n                        if (dp[i][j][l][state] == Long.MAX_VALUE) continue;\n                        long cur = dp[i][j][l][state];\n\n                        if (i < V) {\n                            int pos = v.get(i);\n                            int cost = countLess(v, i, pos) + countLess(k, j, pos) + countLess(x, l, pos);\n                            dp[i+1][j][l][1] = Math.min(dp[i+1][j][l][1], cur + cost);\n                        }\n\n                        if (j < K && state == 0) {\n                            int pos = k.get(j);\n                            int cost = countLess(v, i, pos) + countLess(k, j, pos) + countLess(x, l, pos);\n                            dp[i][j+1][l][0] = Math.min(dp[i][j+1][l][0], cur + cost);\n                        }\n\n                        if (l < X) {\n                            int pos = x.get(l);\n                            int cost = countLess(v, i, pos) + countLess(k, j, pos) + countLess(x, l, pos);\n                            dp[i][j][l+1][0] = Math.min(dp[i][j][l+1][0], cur + cost);\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\n        long result = Math.min(dp[V][K][X][0], dp[V][K][X][1]);\n        out.println(result);\n\n        sc.close();\n        out.close();\n    }\n\n    private int countLess(List<Integer> list, int idx, int val) {\n        int cnt = 0;\n        for (int i = 0; i < idx; i++) {\n            if (list.get(i) < val) cnt++;\n        }\n        return cnt;\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        new E();\n    }\n}\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "qwen/qwen3-coder-next"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\nimport sys\n\ndef main():\n    data = sys.stdin.read().split()\n    n = int(data[0])\n    s = data[1]\n    \n    v = []\n    k = []\n    x = []\n    \n    for i in range(n):\n        c = s[i]\n        if c == 'V':\n            v.append(i)\n 